ng\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Ticket price</span></dt><dd>Free</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Location</span></dt><dd>Prince Charles Cinema</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/time_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Date and time</span></dt><dd>Thu 23 Jul 2026 • 8PM</dd></div></dl><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/event/cinesocial-babylon-at-the-pcc\">Learn More</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"club-events-section\"><h2>Past Events</h2><div class=\"club-events-grid\"><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-past\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/v1773272598/development/ugahvweg0yszlquv6n9x.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"card-status-badge-stack\"><span class=\"card-status-badge\">Past</span></div><h3>Cinebug turns 1 - Mystery Movie</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><dl class=\"club-tile-facts\" aria-label=\"Cinebug turns 1 - Mystery Movie details\"><div><dt><img src=\"/images/ticket_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Ticket price</span></dt><dd>£11.50</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Location</span></dt><dd>Carnegie St, London</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/time_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Date and time</span></dt><dd>Sat 28 Mar 2026 • 6:30PM</dd></div></dl><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/event/cinebug-mystery-bday-film\">Learn More</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"club-events-section\"><h2>Similar Clubs in london</h2><div class=\"club-events-grid\"><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/cdzt95zdztpj4lswyx6j.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>farrago</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"farrago interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/gaming/1\">Gaming</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">a creative community run by friends who throw house parties\n\nevery wednesday in shoreditch, we platform the best live music and creative talent in this special city\n\nno phones - free drink on arrival - meet new people</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/farrago\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/v1780316463/production/iusl72agw5vjes3igsz5.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>Lahira Lashes IRL</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Lahira Lashes IRL interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">For the woman who is done waiting for her era to begin.\n\nThis is a space for women in London who move with intention, lead with taste and never follow the crowd. Whether you&#x27;re into beauty, wellness or simply living your life like the main character, you belong here.\n\nWe meet in real life. Matcha walks. Beauty moments. Good energy. The kind of community that makes you feel like the best version of yourself before you&#x27;ve even got home.\n\nThis isn&#x27;t just a club. It&#x27;s a movement for women who know that owning your era isn&#x27;t a moment, it&#x27;s a lifestyle.\n\nLahira Lashes for the girl owning her era 💕\n\n#OwnYourEra</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/lahira-lashes-irl\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/yx1rlqxuluvbbmdjvpsh.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>Northside Socials</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Northside Socials interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/food%20%26%20drink/1\">Food &amp; Drink</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Barnet, UK</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">For those tired of 2 hour trek south of the river 😅\n\nThis little club is for socials and events within the northern boroughs- Barnet and beyond. \n\nEveryone welcome 🤗</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/northside-socials\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/iw6fj2qtctgl5soqsuvt.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>The Film Club</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"The Film Club interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/gender%20specific/1\">Gender Specific</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/social/1\">Social</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">The first rule of Film Club: You talk about Film Club.\u000b\n\nThe second rule of Film Club: You must talk about Film Club.\u000b\n\nBecause honestly, who can resist making friends while chatting about great films?\n\nWhat we’re about:\u000b\n\n📎 A third space for the women+ cinephile community\n💫 Monthly gatherings every second Saturday to discuss our Pick of the Month, chosen by members (book-club style)\n🎥 Cinema Clubs with private screenings and post-film socials\n🍿 Casual, member-led hangouts to catch the latest releases together\n☕ A warm, welcoming space where every conversation feels like catching up with friends over coffee\n\nWhether you’re a lifelong film lover or just starting your cinematic journey, you’ve just found your place ♡⸜(˶˃ ᵕ ˂˶)⸝♡\n\nFind out more and join us on Instagram ⤷ @thefilmclubldn</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/the-film-club\">Learn More</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"download-panel-figma share-download-panel\"><img class=\"download-mark\" src=\"/images/brand/logo-mark.svg\" alt=\"CLIQ\"/><h2>Find your CLIQ</h2><p>Download on iPhone and Android</p><div class=\"store-row\"><a class=\"store-badge-image store-badge-google\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.thecliq.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Get it on Google Play\"><img src=\"/images/icons/google-play.svg\" alt=\"Get it on Google Play\"/></a><a class=\"store-badge-image store-badge-apple\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cliq-meet-people-irl/id6451363528\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Download on the App Store\"><img src=\"/images/icons/app-store.svg\" alt=\"Download on the App Store\"/></a></div></section><section class=\"social-strip-figma\" id=\"social\"><h2>Follow @findyourcliq</h2><div class=\"social-strip-grid\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" hei