/logo.svg\" alt=\"CLIQ\"/></span></div></div></section><section class=\"club-events-section\"><h2>Similar Clubs in london</h2><div class=\"club-events-grid\"><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/icbwjicvjzhk3g2aqqox.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>Sonderhaus</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Sonderhaus interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">A cultural community building intentional third spaces through games, art, film and conversation in London</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/sonderhaus\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/gahxbejwqpsftq9duhpk.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>London 25+ meetups</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"London 25+ meetups interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">Tired of the same old routine? If you&#x27;re looking to meet people outside of bars and clubs, this is for you. We gather in small groups for walks, hikes, and coffee dates to slowly build a meaningful community. Cap for every event  is set at 10 entries, so grab your spot now!</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/london-25-meetups\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/iw6fj2qtctgl5soqsuvt.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>The Film Club</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"The Film Club interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/gender%20specific/1\">Gender Specific</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/social/1\">Social</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">The first rule of Film Club: You talk about Film Club.\u000b\n\nThe second rule of Film Club: You must talk about Film Club.\u000b\n\nBecause honestly, who can resist making friends while chatting about great films?\n\nWhat we’re about:\u000b\n\n📎 A third space for the women+ cinephile community\n💫 Monthly gatherings every second Saturday to discuss our Pick of the Month, chosen by members (book-club style)\n🎥 Cinema Clubs with private screenings and post-film socials\n🍿 Casual, member-led hangouts to catch the latest releases together\n☕ A warm, welcoming space where every conversation feels like catching up with friends over coffee\n\nWhether you’re a lifelong film lover or just starting your cinematic journey, you’ve just found your place ♡⸜(˶˃ ᵕ ˂˶)⸝♡\n\nFind out more and join us on Instagram ⤷ @thefilmclubldn</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/the-film-club\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/pfwh1tt4irx7whmfanye.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>The Siren Circle</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"The Siren Circle interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/gender%20specific/1\">Gender Specific</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">The Siren Circle is a community for women seeking deeper connection, reflection and growth.  \n\nWe host a curated programme of events including sharing circles, supper clubs, co-working sessions and socials - all designed to create space for real conversation.\n\nInspired by the ancient myth of sirens, our mission is to support women to break away from outdated narratives of who they are and should be, and live in ways that feel more true to them.</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/the-siren-circle\">Learn More</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"download-panel-figma share-download-panel\"><img class=\"download-mark\" src=\"/images/brand/logo-mark.svg\" alt=\"CLIQ\"/><h2>Find your CLIQ</h2><p>Download on iPhone and Android</p><div class=\"store-row\"><a class=\"store-badge-image store-badge-google\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.thecliq.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Get it on Google Play\"><img src=\"/images/icons/google-play.svg\" alt=\"Get it on Google Play\"/></a><a class=\"store-badge-image store-badge-apple\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cliq-meet-people-irl/id6451363528\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Download on the App Store\"><img src=\"/images/icons/app-store.svg\" alt=\"Download on the App Store\"/></a></div></section><section class=\"social-strip-figma\" id=\"social\"><h2>Follow @findyourcliq</h2><div class=\"social-strip-grid\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 50vw, 16vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj\"/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 50vw, 16vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-2.jpg&amp;w=12