<div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"club-page\"><section class=\"announcement-bar\"><p><a href=\"/#download\">download the app</a><span> | </span><a href=\"/community#join\">start your community</a></p></section><header class=\"menu-bar\"><a href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Go to CLIQ home\"><img class=\"brand-logo\" src=\"/images/brand/logo.svg\" alt=\"CLIQ\"/></a><nav class=\"menu-links\" aria-label=\"Primary\"><a class=\"figma-btn figma-btn-text\" href=\"/about\"><span>ABOUT CLIQ</span></a><a class=\"figma-btn figma-btn-text\" href=\"/discover\"><span>Discover</span></a><a class=\"figma-btn figma-btn-text\" href=\"/community\"><span>Community</span></a><a class=\"figma-btn figma-btn-text\" href=\"/brands\"><span>Brands</span></a><a class=\"figma-btn figma-btn-text\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Contact</span></a><a class=\"figma-btn figma-btn-purple\" href=\"https://events.thecliq.app/\"><span>Club Login</span></a></nav><details class=\"mobile-menu\"><summary aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\"><span class=\"mobile-menu-label\">MENU</span><span class=\"mobile-menu-close\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span></span></summary><nav class=\"mobile-menu-panel\" aria-label=\"Mobile primary\"><a href=\"/about\">ABOUT CLIQ</a><a href=\"/discover\">Discover</a><a href=\"/community\">Community</a><a href=\"/brands\">Brands</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a href=\"https://events.thecliq.app/\">Club Login</a></nav></details></header><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"The Film Club\",\"description\":\"The first rule of Film Club: You talk about Film Club. The second rule of Film Club: You must talk about Film Club. Because honestly, who can resist making friends while chatting about great films? What we’re about: 📎 A third space for the women+ cinephile co\",\"url\":\"https://thecliq.app/club/the-film-club\",\"image\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/iw6fj2qtctgl5soqsuvt.jpg\",\"keywords\":\"Community, Entertainment, Female, Films, Intersex Women, Meet ups, Networking, Nonbinary, Non-Binary, Nonbinary Women, Social, Socials, Transfeminine, Transgender, Trans Women\",\"event\":[{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Battle of the Sexes (2017) Social Screening\",\"url\":\"https://thecliq.app/event/battle-of-the-sexes-2017-social-screening\",\"startDate\":\"2026-07-05T12:00:00.000Z\",\"location\":\"COLDHARBOUR BLUE\"}]}</script><section class=\"club-hero\"><div class=\"club-logo-panel\"><img class=\"club-logo-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/iw6fj2qtctgl5soqsuvt.jpg\" alt=\"The Film Club club image\"/></div><div class=\"club-details-panel\"><div class=\"club-details-top\"><div class=\"club-details-brand\"><img class=\"club-details-logo\" src=\"/images/brand/logo.svg\" alt=\"CLIQ\"/><div class=\"detail-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/gender%20specific/1\">Gender Specific</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/social/1\">Social</a></div></div><a class=\"figma-btn figma-btn-purple\" href=\"cliq://clubs/the-film-club?entry_point=www&amp;source=cliq_website\"><span>OPEN IN APP</span></a></div><div class=\"club-details-copy\"><h1>The Film Club</h1><p>The first rule of Film Club: You talk about Film Club.\u000b\n\nThe second rule of Film Club: You must talk about Film Club.\u000b\n\nBecause honestly, who can resist making friends while chatting about great films?\n\nWhat we’re about:\u000b\n\n📎 A third space for the women+ cinephile community\n💫 Monthly gatherings every second Saturday to discuss our Pick of the Month, chosen by members (book-club style)\n🎥 Cinema Clubs with private screenings and post-film socials\n🍿 Casual, member-led hangouts to catch the latest releases together\n☕ A warm, welcoming space where every conversation feels like catching up with friends over coffee\n\nWhether you’re a lifelong film lover or just starting your cinematic journey, you’ve just found your place ♡⸜(˶˃ ᵕ ˂˶)⸝♡\n\nFind out more and join us on Instagram ⤷ @thefilmclubldn</p></div><div class=\"club-qr-row detail-qr-box\"><span class=\"detail-qr-heading\">SCAN TO JOIN</span><div class=\"club-qr-code\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Scan to join The Film Club on CLIQ\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 35 35\" shape-rendering=\"crispEdges\"><path fill=\"#ffffff\" d=\"M0 0h35v35H0z\"/><path stroke=\"#000000\" d=\"M1 1.5h7m1 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1m3 0h2m1 0h2m4 0h7M1 2.5h1m5 0h1m1 0h1m3 0h2m4 0h2m2 0h1m3 0h1m5 0h1M1 3.5h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h3m4 0h3m1 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h1M1 4.5h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m5 0h1m1 0h3m2 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h1M1 5.5h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h2m3 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h1M1 6.5h1m5 0h1m2 0h3m2 0h1m1 0h2m2 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h1m5 0h1M1 7.5h7m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h7M10 8.5h1m1 0h4m1 0h1m2 0h2m2 0h1M1 9.5h1m2 0h9m2 0h4m5 0h3m2 0h1m1 0h3M1 10.5h2m2 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h3m2 0h3m2 0h3m1 0h1M1 11.5h1m1 0h1m1 0h4m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h2m3 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h1m2 0h5M1 12.5h1m3 0h1m3 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h1m3 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1m2 0h3M1 13.5h1m1 0h6m2 0h4m1 0h1m4 0h1m2 0h2m1 0h1m2 0h1M2 14.5h3m1 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h3m4 0h1m1 0h1m6 0h2M1 15.5h3m1 0h3m1 0h2m1 0h5m1 0h3m1 0h2m2 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1M1 16.5h6m4 0h4m2 0h1m5 0h4m1 0h5M6 17.5h4m2 0h1m7 0h2m1 0h2m1 0h5m2 0h1M1 18.5h3m2 0h1m2 0h2m1 0h2m1 0h2m1 0h4m1 0h1m3 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1M1 19.5h2m1 0h1m2 0h2m1 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h2m3 0h1m2 0h5m3 0h1m1 0h1M1 20.5h1m1 0h4m1 0h5m3 0h2m2 0h2m1 0h3m1 0h5m1 0h1M1 21.5h2m1 0h2m1 0h1m6 0h2m1 0h2m11 0h1m1 0h2M1 22.5h1m2 0h2m2 0h4m1 0h4m1 0h3m2 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h3M1 23.5h1m1 0h1m1 0h3m3 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h3m3 0h5m1 0h2m2 0h2M1 24.5h1m2 0h3m2 0h1m6 0h5m7 0h1m2 0h2M1 25.5h2m4 0h2m2 0h1m3 0h2m3 0h2m1 0h8M9 26.5h2m1 0h5m8 0h1m3 0h1m1 0h1M1 27.5h7m1 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h3m2 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h3M1 28.5h1m5 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h6m2 0h1m3 0h2m3 0h1m1 0h1M1 29.5h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h4m1 0h1m1 0h2m3 0h1m2 0h6m3 0h1M1 30.5h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h5m2 0h2m3 0h1m1 0h2M1 31.5h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h2m1 0h3M1 32.5h1m5 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h2m3 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h2m1 0h5M1 33.5h7m1 0h1m1 0h3m2 0h3m6 0h4\"/></svg>\n</div><span class=\"detail-qr-footer\"><img src=\"/images/brand/logo.svg\" alt=\"CLIQ\"/></span></div></div></section><section class=\"club-events-section\"><h2>Upcoming Events</h2><div class=\"club-events-grid\"><article class=\"club-tile-card\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/v1781626317/production/ooxvjlw3dug8bhwjy8dk.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"card-status-badge-stack\"></div><h3>Battle of the Sexes (2017) Social Screening</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><dl class=\"club-tile-facts\" aria-label=\"Battle of the Sexes (2017) Social Screening details\"><div><dt><img src=\"/images/ticket_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Ticket price</span></dt><dd>£15</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Location</span></dt><dd>COLDHARBOUR BLUE</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/time_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Date and time</span></dt><dd>Sun 5 Jul 2026 • 1PM</dd></div></dl><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/event/battle-of-the-sexes-2017-social-screening\">Learn More</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"club-events-section\"><h2>Past Events</h2><div class=\"club-events-grid\"><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-past\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/v1779881751/production/ucfnqsnzafd5ddyu4zco.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"card-status-badge-stack\"><span class=\"card-status-badge\">Past</span></div><h3>Twilight Saga All Nighter Hangout</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><dl class=\"club-tile-facts\" aria-label=\"Twilight Saga All Nighter Hangout details\"><div><dt><img src=\"/images/ticket_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Ticket price</span></dt><dd>Free</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Location</span></dt><dd>15 Great Windmill Street, London</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/time_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Date and time</span></dt><dd>Sat 20 Jun 2026 • 8PM</dd></div></dl><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/event/twilight-saga-all-nighter-hangout\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-past\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/v1780244683/production/cmuxpamfjuqmiwisbufc.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"card-status-badge-stack\"><span class=\"card-status-badge\">Past</span></div><h3>Project Hail Mary Film Discussion </h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><dl class=\"club-tile-facts\" aria-label=\"Project Hail Mary Film Discussion  details\"><div><dt><img src=\"/images/ticket_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Ticket price</span></dt><dd>£10.70</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Location</span></dt><dd>BFI Southbank, Belvedere Rd, London</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/time_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Date and time</span></dt><dd>Sun 14 Jun 2026 • 2PM</dd></div></dl><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/event/project-hail-mary-film-discussion\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-past\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/v1772462007/development/mjdaj4u1qodum4q6ddpu.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"card-status-badge-stack\"><span class=\"card-status-badge\">Past</span></div><h3>Film Journal Social Workshop </h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><dl class=\"club-tile-facts\" aria-label=\"Film Journal Social Workshop  details\"><div><dt><img src=\"/images/ticket_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Ticket price</span></dt><dd>£10</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Location</span></dt><dd>Damsel Collective</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/time_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Date and time</span></dt><dd>Sat 6 Jun 2026 • 2PM</dd></div></dl><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/event/film-journal-social-workshop-2\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-past\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/v1779641639/production/vpop8v86c5tsfymur1sc.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"card-status-badge-stack\"><span class=\"card-status-badge\">Past</span></div><h3>Hen Cinema Hangout</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><dl class=\"club-tile-facts\" aria-label=\"Hen Cinema Hangout details\"><div><dt><img src=\"/images/ticket_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Ticket price</span></dt><dd>Free</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Location</span></dt><dd>The Garden Cinema</dd></div><div><dt><img src=\"/images/time_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Date and time</span></dt><dd>Thu 28 May 2026 • 6PM</dd></div></dl><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/event/hen-cinema-hangout\">Learn More</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"club-events-section\"><h2>Similar Clubs in london</h2><div class=\"club-events-grid\"><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/aqpe3xs8gwexu0drdp2b.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>just for joy</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"just for joy interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/food%20%26%20drink/1\">Food &amp; Drink</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">No pressure wellness &amp; community events where the focus is simple: joy 🫧\n\nPastry crawls, dance classes, collaging &amp; vision boarding hangouts, we’ve done it all and we’re continuously exploring and sharing new ideas!\n\n\n\nCheck us out for previous events &amp; vibes: @justforjoyspace\n\nBring a friend or come solo and make new ones 🫶🏽</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/just-for-joy\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/csalz8ebhimee6qb3w4u.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>Lisa’s Strength Club</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Lisa’s Strength Club interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/food%20%26%20drink/1\">Food &amp; Drink</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/social/1\">Social</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/sports%20%26%20fitness/1\">Sports &amp; Fitness</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">Strength, Calisthenics &amp; Community \n360 training method by Lisa Mags\nTrain with us online or IRL\n\nAccessible Calisthenics classes at The Ministry every Tuesday at 19:45</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/lisas-strength-club\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/drp7ioxycxp4d9acf1qo.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>The Chronic Coffee Club</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"The Chronic Coffee Club interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/food%20%26%20drink/1\">Food &amp; Drink</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">Your women’s health hub in London! Come for the coffee, stay for the community.</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/the-chronic-coffee-club\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/rfuyne3h6ufyc6tlqtyx.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>Connected You Community | Friendship &amp; Wellbeing</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Connected You Community | Friendship &amp; Wellbeing interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/gender%20specific/1\">Gender Specific</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/social/1\">Social</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/wellbeing/1\">Wellbeing</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">Connected You is more than just a community; it’s a movement for belonging. What began as a women-only space has evolved into an inclusive, welcoming home for people from all walks of life. Here, you are seen, heard, and supported.\n\nWe don’t do surface-level connections. Our workshops, circles, and events create spaces for meaningful conversations, genuine friendships, and personal growth. Guided by compassion, acceptance, and the belief that we are stronger together, we provide a sanctuary where you can show up as you are.\n\nFounded by Essi Auguste Virtanen, a journalist-turned-coach, Connected You is built on the power of storytelling and connection to heal, unite, and transform lives. \n\nWe believe that we can combat loneliness and depression by creating spaces for meaningful, vulnerable connecting where we co-create healing with shared stories, wisdom and partaking in connecting activities and rituals as a community.\n\nWhat We Stand For\nWe are a community of realness, courage, and connection—a space where stories and shared experiences inspire, heal, and create a sense of belonging.\n💛 Connect with Yourself through self-inquiry, coaching, movement, and personal development. 💛 Connect with Others through small-group events, deep conversations, and shared experiences. 💛 Connect with the Wider World and Something Higher through nature connection, mindfulness, spirituality, and a sense of collective responsibility.\n\nOur Mission\nTo actively combat loneliness, depression, and suicide through safe, heart-led, inclusive spaces.\nTo make community support and connection accessible to all—no one should be denied community due to financial constraints.</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/connected-you-community-or-friendship-and-wellbeing\">Learn More</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"download-panel-figma share-download-panel\"><img class=\"download-mark\" src=\"/images/brand/logo-mark.svg\" alt=\"CLIQ\"/><h2>Find your CLIQ</h2><p>Download on iPhone and Android</p><div class=\"store-row\"><a class=\"store-badge-image store-badge-google\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.thecliq.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Get it on Google Play\"><img src=\"/images/icons/google-play.svg\" alt=\"Get it on Google Play\"/></a><a class=\"store-badge-image store-badge-apple\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cliq-meet-people-irl/id6451363528\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Download on the App Store\"><img src=\"/images/icons/app-store.svg\" alt=\"Download on the App Store\"/></a></div></section><section class=\"social-strip-figma\" id=\"social\"><h2>Follow @findyourcliq</h2><div class=\"social-strip-grid\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 50vw, 16vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp