])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"London\\\"}]\\n20:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-description\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Your women’s health hub in London! Come for the coffee, stay for the community.\\\"}]\\n21:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"event-card-link\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/club/the-chronic-coffee-club\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Learn More\\\"}]\\n24:T69a,\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"Connected You is more than just a community; it’s a movement for belonging. What began as a women-only space has evolved into an inclusive, welcoming home for people from all walks of life. Here, you are seen, heard, and supported.\\n\\nWe don’t do surface-level connections. Our workshops, circles, and events create spaces for meaningful conversations, genuine friendships, and personal growth. Guided by compassion, acceptance, and the belief that we are stronger together, we provide a sanctuary where you can show up as you are.\\n\\nFounded by Essi Auguste Virtanen, a journalist-turned-coach, Connected You is built on the power of storytelling and connection to heal, unite, and transform lives. \\n\\nWe believe that we can combat loneliness and depression by creating spaces for meaningful, vulnerable connecting where we co-create healing with shared stories, wisdom and partaking in connecting activities and rituals as a community.\\n\\nWhat We Stand For\\nWe are a community of realness, courage, and connection—a space where stories and shared experiences inspire, heal, and create a sense of belonging.\\n💛 Connect with Yourself through self-inquiry, coaching, movement, and personal development.\\u2028💛 Connect with Others through small-group events, deep conversations, and shared experiences.\\u2028💛 Connect with the Wider World and Something Higher through nature connection, mindfulness, spirituality, and a sense of collective responsibility.\\n\\nOur Mission\\nTo actively combat loneliness, depression, and suicide through safe, heart-led, inclusive spaces.\\nTo make community support and connection accessible to all—no one should be denied community due to financial constraints.\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"22:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",\\\"connected-you-community-or-friendship-and-wellbeing\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-media-wrap\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L15\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-media\\\",\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/rfuyne3h6ufyc6tlqtyx.png\\\",\\\"wordmarkSrc\\\":\\\"/images/brand/logo.svg\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Connected You Community | Friendship \\u0026 Wellbeing\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-copy\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-tag-pills\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Connected You Community | Friendship \\u0026 Wellbeing interests\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Gender Specific\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/gender%20specific/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Gender Specific\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Social\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/social/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Social\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Wellbeing\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/wellbeing/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Wellbeing\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"card-location\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/location_icon.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"London\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-description\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$24\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"cla