 0h3m1 0h1m2 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h1m6 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h1m4 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1M1 36.5h1m5 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h5m1 0h1m4 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m4 0h6M1 37.5h7m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h2m5 0h1m3 0h2m3 0h1m1 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h1\"/></svg>\n</div><span class=\"detail-qr-footer\"><img src=\"/images/brand/logo.svg\" alt=\"CLIQ\"/></span></div></div></section><section class=\"club-events-section\"><h2>Similar Clubs in london</h2><div class=\"club-events-grid\"><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/icbwjicvjzhk3g2aqqox.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>Sonderhaus</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Sonderhaus interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">A cultural community building intentional third spaces through games, art, film and conversation in London</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/sonderhaus\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/cdzt95zdztpj4lswyx6j.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>farrago</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"farrago interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/gaming/1\">Gaming</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">a creative community run by friends who throw house parties\n\nevery wednesday in shoreditch, we platform the best live music and creative talent in this special city\n\nno phones - free drink on arrival - meet new people</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/farrago\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/v1780316463/production/iusl72agw5vjes3igsz5.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>Lahira Lashes IRL</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Lahira Lashes IRL interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">For the woman who is done waiting for her era to begin.\n\nThis is a space for women in London who move with intention, lead with taste and never follow the crowd. Whether you&#x27;re into beauty, wellness or simply living your life like the main character, you belong here.\n\nWe meet in real life. Matcha walks. Beauty moments. Good energy. The kind of community that makes you feel like the best version of yourself before you&#x27;ve even got home.\n\nThis isn&#x27;t just a club. It&#x27;s a movement for women who know that owning your era isn&#x27;t a moment, it&#x27;s a lifestyle.\n\nLahira Lashes for the girl owning her era 💕\n\n#OwnYourEra</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/lahira-lashes-irl\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/jxv04vkux7bzxnqcakba.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>Cosy Café Sketchers</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Cosy Café Sketchers interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">Welcome! Come join for some casual and chill people drawing sessions no matter your skill level.\n\nWhether you’re brushing up on your art skills or want to try something new, lets bring our art supplies and fill our sketchbooks at some cosy cafes!\n\nWe’ll be gathering at local cafes in London where you can expect to let your creativity flow while connecting with like-minded and friendly artists. Let&#x27;s grab a coffee, sketch, and connect through our shared love for art!</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/cosy-cafe-sketchers\">Learn More</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"download-panel-figma share-download-panel\"><img class=\"download-mark\" src=\"/images/brand/logo-mark.svg\" alt=\"CLIQ\"/><h2>Find your CLIQ</h2><p>Download on iPhone and Android</p><div class=\"store-row\"><a class=\"store-badge-image store-badge-google\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.thecliq.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Get it on Google Play\"><img src=\"/images/icons/google-play.svg\" alt=\"Get it on Google Play\"/></a><a class=\"store-badge-image store-badge-apple\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cliq-meet-people-irl/id6451363528\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Download on the App Store\"><img src=\"/images/icons/app-store.svg\" alt=\"Do