 simply living your life like the main character, you belong here.\\\\n\\\\nWe meet in real life. Matcha walks. Beauty moments. Good energy. The kind of community that makes you feel like the best version of yourself before you've even got home.\\\\n\\\\nThis isn't just a club. It's a movement for women who know that owning your era isn't a moment, it's a lifestyle.\\\\n\\\\nLahira Lashes for the girl owning her era 💕\\\\n\\\\n#OwnYourEra\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"event-card-link\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/club/lahira-lashes-irl\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Learn More\\\"}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",\\\"cosy-cafe-sketchers\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-media-wrap\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L16\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-media\\\",\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/jxv04vkux7bzxnqcakba.jpg\\\",\\\"wordmarkSrc\\\":\\\"/images/brand/logo.svg\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Cosy Café Sketchers\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-copy\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-tag-pills\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Cosy Café Sketchers interests\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Arts\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/arts/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Arts\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Business\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/business/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Business\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Entertainment\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Entertainment\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"card-location\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/location_icon.png\\\"