\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/cdzt95zdztpj4lswyx6j.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>farrago</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"farrago interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/gaming/1\">Gaming</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">a creative community run by friends who throw house parties\n\nevery wednesday in shoreditch, we platform the best live music and creative talent in this special city\n\nno phones - free drink on arrival - meet new people</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/farrago\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/wfxu4azrm08uhbfiafhh.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>Greater Creatives</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Greater Creatives interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>Greater London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">Tired of all the creator events/ hang outs being in East or South London? SAME! \n\nSo, I decided to start one.\n\nThe idea is for creatives to come together, share ideas, hang out and/or collaborate. If you live in greater west London and are a creator full-time, as a side-hustle, hobby or somewhere in between. Join the club!</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/greater-creatives\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/byvyzypdvlorqhjyl0kd.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>Laoxa’s Creative Ground</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"Laoxa’s Creative Ground interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">Hiya! I’m Lucy, I’m the founder of Laoxa - a multidisciplinary purpose-driven food and arts brand based in Tottenham, London. \n\nWe host immersive pop-up events called Laoxa’s Creative Ground - a welcoming community celebrating food, creativity and connection in London and across the U.K.  \n\nWhat we do: • Host Free-entry pop-up markets • Catering: Ghanaian soul food \n• Hand-piped floral &amp; 3D cupcakes &amp; cupcake bouquets  • Creative workshops &amp; Rug Tufting • Supper clubs &amp; community dining • The Yellow Telephone experience - leave a message to your future self • Community legacy rug projects\n•Handcrafted products as seen on This Morning, Apple U.S., RadioTimes and Good Housekeeping UK. \n\nJoin us to meet like-minded people, support independent traders and be part of meaningful creative experiences.</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/laoxas-creative-ground\">Learn More</a></div></article><article class=\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\"><div class=\"club-tile-media-wrap\"><div class=\"club-tile-media\"><img class=\"club-card-media-image\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/lsgqlfo8e7inpl4itnxz.png\" alt=\"\"/></div><h3>The Single Girls Club</h3></div><div class=\"club-tile-copy\"><div class=\"club-tile-tag-pills\" aria-label=\"The Single Girls Club interests\"><a href=\"/discover/interest/arts/1\">Arts</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/business/1\">Business</a><a href=\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\">Entertainment</a></div><p class=\"card-location\"><img src=\"/images/location_icon.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"/><span>London</span></p><p class=\"club-tile-description\">The Single Girls Club is a community for women aged 25-35 who are embracing single life and building real friendships along the way. It’s a safe, supportive space for honesty and vulnerability, where we can share the highs and lows of life with girls who truly understand. Everyone is in a similar stage, figuring things out, growing, and finding joy in independence while connecting with others who just get it.\n\nWe host fun, girly events that bring everyone together. Think seasonal get-togethers, wellness days, self-care activities, and nights out where you can dress up, eat, drink, and have the best time. It’s all about doing the things you love, even when you don’t have someone to do them with, and creating genuine friendships along the way.\n\nFollow us on Instagram: @TheSingleGirlsClub44\n\nCheck our website out:\nwww.thesinglegirlsclub44.com</p><a class=\"event-card-link\" href=\"/club/the-single-girls-club\">Learn More</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"download-panel-figma share-download-panel\"><img class=\"download-mark\" src=\"/images/brand/logo-mark.svg\" alt=\"CLIQ\"/><h2>Find your CLIQ</h2><p>Download on iPhone and Android</p><div class=\"store-row\"><a class=\"store-badge-image store-badge-google\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.thecliq.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Get it on Google Play\"><img src=\"/images/icons/google-play.svg\" alt=\"Get it on Google Play\"/></a><a class=\"store-badge-image store-badge-apple\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cliq-meet-people-irl/id6451363528\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Download on the App Store\"><img src=\"/images/icons/app-store.svg\" alt=\"Download on the App Store\"/></a></div></section><section class=\"social-strip-figma\" id=\"social\"><h2>Follow @findyourcliq</h2><div class=\"social-strip-grid\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 50vw, 16vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7t8mYvsRNTCDib4Tj 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsocial%2Fsocial-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_97KEFrZ4bAa7