ll,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Greater London\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-description\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Tired of all the creator events/ hang outs being in East or South London? SAME! \\\\n\\\\nSo, I decided to start one.\\\\n\\\\nThe idea is for creatives to come together, share ideas, hang out and/or collaborate. If you live in greater west London and are a creator full-time, as a side-hustle, hobby or somewhere in between. Join the club!\\\"}],\\\"$L18\\\"]}]]}],\\\"$L19\\\",\\\"$L1a\\\"]}]]}]]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"event-card-link\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/club/greater-creatives\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Learn More\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"19:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",\\\"laoxas-creative-ground\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-media-wrap\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L16\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-media\\\",\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/byvyzypdvlorqhjyl0kd.png\\\",\\\"wordmarkSrc\\\":\\\"/images/brand/logo.svg\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Laoxa’s Creative Ground\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-copy\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-tag-pills\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Laoxa’s Creative Ground interests\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Arts\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/arts/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Arts\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Business\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/business/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Business\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Entertainment\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Entertainment\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"card-location\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/location_icon.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"London\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-description\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Hiya! I’m Lucy, I’m the founder of Laoxa - a multidisciplinary purpose-driven food and arts brand based in Tottenham, London. \\\\n\\\\nWe host immersive pop-up events called Laoxa’s Creative Ground - a welcoming community celebrating food, creativity and connection in London and across the U.K.  \\\\n\\\\nWhat we do:\\u2028• Host Free-entry pop-up markets\\u2028• Catering: Ghanaian soul food \\\\n• Hand-piped floral \\u0026 3D cupcakes \\u0026 cupcake bouquets \\u2028• Creative workshops \\u0026 Rug Tufting\\u2028• Supper clubs \\u0026 community dining\\u2028• The Yellow Telephone experience - leave a message to your future self\\u2028• Community legacy rug projects\\\\n•Handcrafted products as seen on This Morning, Apple U.S., RadioTimes and Good Housekeeping UK. \\\\n\\\\nJoin us to meet like-minded people, support independent traders and be part of meaningful creative experiences.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"event-card-link\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/club/laoxas-creative-ground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Learn More\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",\\\"the-single-girls-club\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-card club-tile-card-similar\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-media-wrap\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L16\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-media\\\",\\\"src\\\":\\\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dienahliq/image/upload/dpr_auto,c_scale,w_auto/production/lsgqlfo8e7inpl4itnxz.png\\\",\\\"wordmarkSrc\\\":\\\"/images/brand/logo.svg\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Single Girls Club\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-copy\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-tag-pills\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"The Single Girls Club interests\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Arts\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/arts/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Arts\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Business\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/business/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Business\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"Entertainment\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/discover/interest/entertainment/1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Entertainment\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"card-location\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/location_icon.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"London\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"club-tile-description\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Single Girls Club is a community for women aged 25-35 who are embracing single life and building real friendships along the way. It’s a safe, supportive space for honesty and vulnerability, where we can share the highs and lows of life with girls who truly understand. Everyone is in a similar stage, figuring things out, growing, and finding joy in independence while connecting with others who just get it.\\\\n\\\\nWe host fun, girly events that bring everyone together. Think seasonal get-togethers, wellness days, self-care activities, and nights out where you can dress up, eat, drink, and have the best time. It’s all about doing the things you love, even when you don’t have someone to do them with, and creating genuine friendships along the way.\\\\n\\\\nFollow us on Instagram: @TheSingleGirlsClub44\\\\n\\\\nCheck our website out:\\\\nwww.thesinglegirlsclub44.com\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"event-card-link\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/club/the-single-girls-club\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Learn More\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1b:T790,\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"\\u003csvg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 35 35\\\" shape-rendering=\\\"crispEdges\\\"\\u003e\\u003cpath fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" d=\\\"M0 0h35v35H0z\\\"/\\u003e\\u003cpath stroke=\\\"#000000\\\" d=\\\"M1 1.5h7m3 0h1m2 0h4m1 0h4m1 0h1m2 0h7M1 2.5h1m5 0h1m6 0h4m3 0h3m3 0h1m5 0h1M1 3.5h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h1m3 0h5m2 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h1M1 4.5h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h2m2 0h1m1 0h2m5 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h1M1 5.5h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h1m3 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h7m2 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h1M1 6.5h1m5 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h5m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m3 0h1m5 0h1M1 7.5h7m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h7M9 8.5h1m2 0h1m2 0h2m2 0h4m1 0h2M1 9.5h1m1 0h5m2 0h1m3 0h5m4 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h5M2 10.5h1m2 0h2m2 0h3m3 0h1m1 0h1m2 0h2m2 0h2m1 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h1M1 11.5h3m2 0h5m1 0h1m3 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h3m2 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h2M1 12.5h2m2 0h1m2 0h1m4 0h1m1 0h1m3 0h1m2 0h4m1 0h1m1 0h4M1 13.5h1m3 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h2m3 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h2m3 0h1M3 14.5h2m1 0h1m4 0h1m1 0h5m2 0h2m2 0h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m2 0h1M2 15.5h6m1 0h2m2 0h1m1 0h1m5 0h2m2 0h1m2 0h2m2 0h1M2 16.5h2m7 0h1m2 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h10m1 0h4M1 17.5h2m1 0h6m2 0h3m2 0h4m2 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h3M1 18.5h6m1 0h1m4 0h1m3 0h1m2 0h3m1 0h1m2 0h2m4 0h1M3 19.5h1m2 0h4m1 0h4m1 0h1m1 0h2m5 0h1m3 0h4M1 20.5h1m7 0h1m4 0h4m2 0h8m1 0h5M3 21.5h1m1 0h4m3 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h2m1 0h2M1 22.5h3m1 0h1m2 0h3m2 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h1m2 0h2m1 0h1M1 23.5h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h4m1 0h3m1 0h3m2 0h3m2 0h2m3 0h2M1 24.5h1m2 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h3m3 0h2m4 0h1m5 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h1M1 25.5h1m1 0h5m3 0h1m1 0h6m4 0h1m1 0h6m2 0h1M9 26.5h1m1 0h1m3 0h1m1 0h5m3 0h1m3 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h1M1 27.5h7m2 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h5m1 0h1m1 0h4M1 28.5h1m5 0h1m1 0h1m2 0h1m1 0h1m2 0h1m3 0h2m1 0h2m3 0h1m1 0h1M1 29.5h1m1 0h3m1 0h1m1 0h1m1 0h2m5 0h1m1 0h2m1 0h1m1 0h6M1 30