            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"data\":{\"event0\":{\"event_id\":\"31c19da1-1fce-459f-beee-8a7ccb7ccf48\",\"name\":\"Jaws at Ciné Real\",\"slug\":\"jaws-cinebug\",\"start_time\":\"2026-06-23T18:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-06-23T21:30:00.000Z\",\"description\":\"As the new Spielberg release approaches and summer draws near, we're celebrating with one of his most beloved classics. Screened on authentic 16mm by legendary projectionist Umit.\\n\\nCapacity is very limited, so secure your seat while you can.\\n\\nDrinks and snacks are included with your ticket.\\n\\nCiné Real, E5 0NS\\n\\nEvent start: 7:00 PM\\nScreening start: 7:30 PM\\n\\nNote: \\n- Doors will be locked at 7:30 PM and there is no reception inside. If you’re running late, please message us in advance, and we’ll do our best to accommodate.\\n\\n- We’ll be taking photos and videos during the event for online use. If you’d prefer not to appear in any of them, just let us know\\n\\n- Tickets are not refundable. You'll have the ability to resell your ticket on the platform once the event sells out.\",\"status\":\"SOLD_OUT\",\"online\":false,\"location\":{\"name\":\"Lower Clapton Road, London E5 0NS, UK\",\"address\":\"Lower Clapton Road, London E5 0NS, UK\",\"latitude\":51.55083465576172,\"longitude\":-0.05210930109024048}},\"event1\":{\"event_id\":\"07ed2e5c-5728-49bb-ad29-29b78784808b\",\"name\":\"CINESOCIAL - Babylon at the PCC\",\"slug\":\"cinesocial-babylon-at-the-pcc\",\"start_time\":\"2026-07-23T19:00:44.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-07-23T22:20:05.000Z\",\"description\":\"It was such a memorable cinema experience for me that I've waited years for the chance to see Babylon on the big screen again.\\n\\nWhether you've seen it before or this is your first time, Babylon deserves to be experienced on the big screen, so join us on Thursday 23rd of July  at the Prince Charles Cinema.\\n\\nPLEASE BOOK YOUR TICKET DIRECTLY THROUGH THE CINEMA'S WEBSITE (we're sitting in C7), then reserve your free ticket here so we know you're coming and can keep you updated with any event details.\\n\\nWe'll be meeting for a drink before the screening — time and venue to be confirmed.\\n\\nSee you there 🥂\",\"status\":\"OPEN\",\"online\":false,\"location\":{\"name\":\"Prince Charles Cinema\",\"address\":\"7 Leicester Pl, London WC2H 7BY, UK\",\"latitude\":51.51144790649414,\"longitude\":-0.13019779324531555}},\"event2\":{\"event_id\":\"959ba4fd-36e5-4de8-8cb9-6dd734245270\",\"name\":\"Battle of the Sexes (2017) Social Screening\",\"slug\":\"battle-of-the-sexes-2017-social-screening\",\"start_time\":\"2026-07-05T12:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-07-05T15:00:00.000Z\",\"description\":\"Step onto the court for an afternoon of film, conversation, and connection 🎾✨\\n\\nJoin us for a special Wimbledon season screening of Battle of the Sexes (2017), the inspiring true story of the legendary tennis match between Billie Jean King and Bobby Riggs. \\n\\nAs Wimbledon takes over London, we are creating a space to celebrate not only tennbis itself, but the human stories behind it. Through Battle of the Sexes, we will explore themes of resilience, performance, confidence, self belief, and the pressure of expectations, both in sport and in everyday life. It is a film that reminds us that some of the most important battles happen long before we step onto the court! \\n\\nFollowing the screening, we will be joined by a professional trainer for a special discussion exploring resilience, performance, mindset, and the realities of athletic life. \\n\\n✨ Expect...\\n⋆ Screening of Battle of the Sexes in the cosy setting of Coldharbour Blue\\n⋆ Popcorn for film time snacking, of course! 🍿\\n⋆ A special guest discussion with a professional trainer on resilience, performance, mindset, and athletic life\\n⋆ A relaxed post screening social with fellow film clubbers\\n⋆ A welcoming atmosphere to connect, unwind, and share perspectives\\n\\n📅 WHEN\\nSunday 5th July | Doors open at 13:00, film starts promptly at 13:15 followed by a social.\\n\\n📍 WHERE\\nColdharbour Blue, 259–260 Hardess Street, Loughborough Junction, London SE24 0HN\\n\\n🎟️ WHY JOIN?\\n⋆ Connect with fellow cinephile women in a friendly, no pressure environment\\n⋆ Gain insights into the mindset and challenges behind athletic performance\\n⋆ Celebrate Wimbledon season in true film club style!\\n⋆ Find your third space, a comfortable place for connection, creativity, and community\\n\\n📌 QUICK INFO\\n⋆ Most attendees come solo, so do not be shy. Our community is warm and welcoming!\\n⋆ This event is open to the women+ community\\n⋆ All ticket sales go towards supporting the running of The Film Club\\n⋆ Any questions? Drop us a message. We are always happy to help!\",\"status\":\"OPEN\",\"online\":false,\"location\":{\"name\":\"COLDHARBOUR BLUE\",\"address\":\"259-260 Hardess Street, Loughborough Junction, London SE24 0HN, UK\",\"latitude\":51.46505355834961,\"longitude\":-0.10102710127830505}}}}\n",
